003e\u003ctd data-row=\"7\" style=\"border-left:solid #000000 1pt;border-right:solid #000000 1pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 1pt;border-top:solid #000000 1pt;vertical-align:middle;padding:5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;\"\u003e\u003cp class=\"ql-table-block ql-align-center\" data-cell=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003ePro 6\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd data-row=\"7\" style=\"border-left:solid #000000 1pt;border-right:solid #000000 1pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 1pt;border-top:solid #000000 1pt;vertical-align:middle;background-color:#ffffff;padding:5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;\"\u003e\u003cp class=\"ql-table-block ql-align-center\" data-cell=\"2\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003e≥ 1,000M \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"ql-table-block ql-align-center\" data-cell=\"2\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003e(API Trading Volume \u0026gt; 20%)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd data-row=\"7\" style=\"border-left:solid #000000 1pt;border-right:solid #000000 1pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 1pt;border-top:solid #000000 1pt;vertical-align:middle;background-color:#ffffff;padding:5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;\"\u003e\u003cp class=\"ql-table-block ql-align-center\" data-cell=\"3\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003e0.0150%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd data-row=\"7\" style=\"border-left:solid #000000 1pt;border-right:solid #000000 1pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 1pt;border-top:solid #000000 1pt;vertical-align:middle;background-color:#ffffff;padding:5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;\"\u003e\u003cp class=\"ql-table-block ql-align-center\" data-cell=\"4\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003e0.0050%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003cp class=\"ql-align-justify\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"ql-align-justify\"\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eNote: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"ql-align-justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003e— Symbols from the Adventure Zone and xStocks follow the existing fee rate above. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"ql-align-justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003e–\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003e \u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eThe Spot Trading fee rate above is only applicable to Crypto Trading pairs. Please refer to the table below for the trading fees applied on Fiat-Crypto Trading Pairs (Eg: USDT/EUR).\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"ql-align-justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003e– Spot trading executed at zero fees will not contribute to your total Spot trading volume.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"ql-align-justify\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"ql-align-justify\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"ql-align-justify\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"ql-align-justify\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"ql-align-justify\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 class=\"ql-align-justify\"\u003e\u003cstrong id=\"ab\" data-anchor=\"ab\" class=\"ql-anchor-placeholder\" style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eFiat Trading Pairs\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp class=\"ql-align-justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eThe Fiat trading fee rates applied to your account will depend on your trading volume or Pro level, whichever is higher. For example, a Pro 3 trader with a 30–Day Spot Trading Volume of 5,000,000 USD will benefit from the Pro 3 trading fee rates of 0.0450% for taker orders and 0.0300% for maker orders.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003e \u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"ql-align-justify\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ctable style=\"border-style: none; border-image: initial; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 0px auto;\" class=\"ql-table-better\"\u003e\u003ccolgroup\u003e\u003ccol width=\"190\" class=\"ql-align-center\"\u003e\u003ccol width=\"192\" class=\"ql-align-center\"\u003e\u003ccol width=\"118\" class=\"ql-align-center\"\u003e\u003ccol width=\"124\" class=\"ql-align-center\"\u003e\u003c/colgroup\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd data-row=\"1\" style=\"border-left:solid #000000 1pt;border-right:solid #000000 1pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 1pt;border-top:solid #000000 1pt;vertical-align:middle;padding:5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;\"\u003e\u003cp class=\"ql-table-block ql-align-center\" data-cell=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003ePro Level \u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd data-row=\"1\" style=\"border-left:solid #000000 1pt;border-right:solid #000000 1pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 1pt;border-top:solid #000000 1pt;vertical-align:middle;padding:5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;\"\u003e\u003cp class=\"ql-table-block ql-align-center\" data-cell=\"2\"\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003e30–Day Spot Trading Volume (USD)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd data-row=\"1\" style=\"border-left:solid #000000 1pt;border-right:solid #000000 1pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 1pt;border-top:solid #000000 1pt;vertical-align:middle;padding:5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;\"\u003e\u003cp class=\"ql-table-block ql-align-center\" data-cell=\"3\"\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\