low-wrap:break-word;\"\u003e\u003cp class=\"ql-table-block ql-align-center\" data-cell=\"2\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003e≥ 1,000,000,000\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003cp class=\"ql-align-justify\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"ql-align-justify\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"ql-align-justify\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"ql-align-justify\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 class=\"ql-align-justify\"\u003e\u003cstrong id=\"ac\" data-anchor=\"ac\" class=\"ql-anchor-placeholder\" style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eP\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cstrong class=\"\" style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eerpetual \u0026amp; Expiry and TradFi Contracts \u003c/em\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp class=\"ql-align-justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eBybit has now grouped a\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"\u003e fee structure for all Perpetual \u0026amp; Expiry and TradFi Contracts. All contracts are \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003econsolidated\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"\u003e into \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eG1 (Major Coins), Altcoin, and TradFi.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 class=\"ql-align-justify\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli data-list=\"bullet\" class=\"ql-align-justify\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"\u003eGroup 1\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"\u003e (e.g., BTCUSDT, ETHUSDT, SOLUSDT, XRPUSDT): High-volume, liquid pairs with reduced Taker fees and adjusted Maker rebates to encourage institutional activity.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list=\"bullet\" class=\"ql-align-justify\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"\u003eAltcoin: \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eHigh Growth, Mid-Tier Liquidity, Mid-Tier Activation, Long Tail \u0026amp; USDC Groups (including Innovation Zone and Pre-listing groups).\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli data-list=\"bullet\" class=\"ql-align-justify\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eTradFi: API and TradFi Pre-Listing \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"ql-align-justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eYour Pro level will be determined based on your last 30-day trading volume.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"ql-align-justify\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ctable style=\"border-style: none; border-image: none; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 0px auto;\" class=\"ql-table-better\"\u003e\u003ccolgroup\u003e\u003ccol width=\"67\"\u003e\u003ccol width=\"86\"\u003e\u003ccol width=\"77\"\u003e\u003ccol width=\"77\"\u003e\u003ccol width=\"77\"\u003e\u003ccol width=\"77\"\u003e\u003ccol width=\"77\"\u003e\u003ccol width=\"77\"\u003e\u003c/colgroup\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd data-row=\"1\" rowspan=\"2\" style=\"border-left:solid #000000 1pt;border-right:solid #000000 1pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 1pt;border-top:solid #000000 1pt;vertical-align:middle;padding:5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;\"\u003e\u003cp class=\"ql-table-block ql-align-center\" data-cell=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"background-color: transp